</span><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">1</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">제 목 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">5</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">기 헌법재판소 대학생 블로그 기자단 모집</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-LEFT: 138.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -135.1pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">2</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">내 용 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">헌법재판소가 제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">5</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">기 대학생 블로그 기자단으로 활동할 학생들을 모집하고 있으니</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">많은 관심과 지원 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">자세한 내용은 붙임 문서 또는 헌법재판소 홈페이지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(http://www.ccourt.go.kr) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">및 헌법재판소 블로그</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(http://blog.daum.net/c_court)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">에서 확인 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-